const DeadlineCore=(()=>{
 const campus=s=>({'University of Washington Seattle':'UW Seattle','University of Washington Bothell':'UW Bothell','University of Washington Tacoma':'UW Tacoma'}[s]||s),term=s=>String(s).replace(/^Fall$/,'Autumn');
 function derive(rule,entryYear){const year=+entryYear+(rule.yearOffset||0);if(!Number.isInteger(+entryYear)||+entryYear<2020||+entryYear>2050||!Number.isInteger(rule.month)||!Number.isInteger(rule.day))return null;const date=new Date(Date.UTC(year,rule.month-1,rule.day));if(date.getUTCMonth()!==rule.month-1||date.getUTCDate()!==rule.day)return null;let adjusted=false;if(rule.weekendRule&&/weekend/i.test(rule.weekendRule)){while([0,6].includes(date.getUTCDay())){date.setUTCDate(date.getUTCDate()+1);adjusted=true}}return{...rule,date:date.toISOString().slice(0,10),cycle:rule.entry+' '+entryYear,dateKind:'annual-rule',dateBasis:'Derived from published annual rule; current-cycle applicability requires confirmation.'+(rule.weekendRule?' '+rule.weekendRule:'')+(rule.weekendRule&&/holiday/i.test(rule.weekendRule)?' Official holiday adjustment has not been verified.':''),closingTime:adjusted&&/5\s*p\.?m\.?/i.test(rule.weekendRule)?'17:00':rule.closingTime||null,adjusted}}
 function candidates(data,filter){const institution=campus(filter.institution),entry=term(filter.entry),year=+filter.year,track=filter.track;if(!Number.isInteger(year)||year<2020||year>2050)return [];const rows=data.datedEvents.filter(r=>r.institution===institution&&(!r.track||r.track===track)&&(!r.tracks||r.tracks.includes(track))&&(!r.program||[r.program,...(r.programAliases||[])].some(p=>String(filter.program||'').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g,'')===String(p).toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g,'')))&&String(r.entry||'').includes(String(year))&&new RegExp('\\b'+entry+'\\b','i').test(term(r.entry||''))).map(r=>({...r,cycle:r.entry,dateKind:'published',dateBasis:r.dateBasis||'Exact dated source snapshot: '+r.sourceYear}));for(const rule of data.annualRules){if(rule.institution!==institution||rule.track!==track||rule.entry!==entry||rule.program&&!String(rule.program).split(/\s*\/\s*/).some(p=>String(filter.program||'').toLowerCase().includes(p.toLowerCase())))continue;const row=derive(rule,year);if(row)rows.push({...row,id:['annual',institution,track,rule.program||'',entry,year,rule.deadlineType].join('|')})}if(institution==='UW Bothell'&&track==='Transfer / post-baccalaureate'&&filter.majorRow!==undefined&&filter.majorRow!==''){const major=data.majorApplicationRules[+filter.majorRow],selected=major?.terms.find(t=>t.entry===entry);if(major&&selected?.offered&&!selected.reviewRequired)for(const rule of selected.rules){const row=derive({...rule,label:major.programLabel+' — '+rule.deadlineType,entry,institution,track,source:major.source,sourceYear:major.sourceYear,scope:'Published transfer/post-baccalaureate major table; confirm the selected program and cycle.'},year);if(row)rows.push({...row,id:['major',filter.majorRow,entry,year,rule.deadlineType].join('|')})}}return rows.sort((a,b)=>a.date.localeCompare(b.date))}
 function basisKind(row){if(['published','annual-rule','entered'].includes(row?.dateKind))return row.dateKind;const text=String(row?.dateBasis||'');if(/^Derived from published annual rule/i.test(text))return 'annual-rule';if(/^(?:Exact dated source snapshot|Source snapshot)/i.test(text))return 'published';return 'entered'}
 function basisLabel(row){return {'published':'Published dated snapshot — confirm cycle','annual-rule':'Derived annual date — confirm cycle','entered':'Entered reminder'}[basisKind(row)]}
 return{campus,term,derive,candidates,basisKind,basisLabel};
})();if(typeof module!=='undefined')module.exports=DeadlineCore;
